sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Player as Player
    participant UI as UIQuestDialog
    participant CQM as Client QuestManager
    participant CSvc as Client QuestService
    participant ClientProto as Client protobuf
    participant Socket as TCP Socket
    participant ServerProto as Server protobuf
    participant Dist as MessageDistributer
    participant QSvc as QuestService
    participant NetSess as NetSession
    participant Char as Character
    participant QMgr as QuestManager
    participant DataMgr as DataManager
    participant QModel as Quest
    participant DBQuest as TCharacterQuest
    participant TCharacter as TCharacter
    participant DBSvc as DBService
    participant EF as ExtremeWorldEntities
    participant SQL as SQL Server
    participant PostResp as Character.PostResponse
    participant StatusMgr as StatusManager

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Player,ClientProto: Phase 1: Client 发起
        Player->>UI: 点击接取任务按钮
        UI->>UI: 校验等级/职业等显示条件
        UI->>CQM: AcceptQuest(quest)
        CQM->>CQM: 校验已接 / 等级前置等客户端预检
        CQM->>CSvc: SendQuestAccept(questId)
        CSvc->>ClientProto: new QuestAcceptRequest
        ClientProto->>Socket: 序列化为 byte 数组
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Socket,SQL: Phase 2: Server 接收 + 业务处理
        Socket->>ServerProto: socket receive byte 数组
        ServerProto->>ServerProto: PackageHandler.ReceiveData
        ServerProto->>Dist: NetMessage.Request.questAccept
        Dist->>QSvc: OnQuestAccept(sender, request)
        activate QSvc
            QSvc->>NetSess: sender.Session.Character
            NetSess-->>QSvc: character 从会话拿
            QSvc->>QSvc: questId = request.QuestId

            QSvc->>Char: character.questManager.AcceptQuest
            Char->>QMgr: AcceptQuest(questId, out Quest quest)

            activate QMgr
                QMgr->>QMgr: quest = null out 初始化

                Note right of QMgr: 防外挂重复接取
                QMgr->>QMgr: if this.Quests.ContainsKey

                Note right of QMgr: 防外挂伪造 ID
                QMgr->>DataMgr: DataManager.Instance.Quests.ContainsKey
                DataMgr-->>QMgr: true / false

                QMgr->>DBSvc: Entities.CharacterQuests.Create
                DBSvc->>EF: Create
                EF-->>DBSvc: new TCharacterQuest
                DBSvc-->>QMgr: dbQuest

                QMgr->>DBQuest: dbQuest.TCharacterID = Owner.Data.ID
                QMgr->>DBQuest: dbQuest.QuestID = questId

                QMgr->>QModel: new Quest(dbQuest)
                activate QModel
                    QModel->>QModel: DbQuest = dbQuest
                    QModel->>DataMgr: DataManager.Instance.Quests[questId]
                    DataMgr-->>QModel: QuestDefine
                    QModel->>QModel: Define = QuestDefine
                deactivate QModel

                QMgr->>QModel: quest.InitQuetsDefine
                Note right of QModel: if Target1 == None → Status=Complated<br/>else → Status=InProgress

                QMgr->>QMgr: this.Quests.Add Manager 字典
                QMgr->>TCharacter: Owner.Data.Quests.Add EF6 跟踪列表

                QMgr->>DBSvc: DBService.Instance.save
                DBSvc->>EF: SaveChanges
                EF->>SQL: INSERT INTO TCharacterQuest
                SQL-->>EF: OK
                EF-->>DBSvc: OK

                QMgr-->>Char: Result.Success + quest
            deactivate QMgr

            QSvc->>NetSess: Response.questAccept = new QuestAcceptResponse
            QSvc->>QModel: quest.ToNQuestInfo
            QModel-->>QSvc: NQuestInfo
            QSvc->>NetSess: Response.questAccept.Quest = NQuestInfo
            QSvc->>NetSess: Response.questAccept.Result = Result.Success
        deactivate QSvc
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over QSvc,Socket: Phase 3: 发包 含 PostResponse 钩子
        QSvc->>NetSess: sender.SendResponse
        NetSess->>NetSess: 触发 GetResponse
        NetSess->>PostResp: if Character != null PostResponse
        activate PostResp
            PostResp->>StatusMgr: statusManager.PostResponse
            StatusMgr->>StatusMgr: Response.statusNotify.Status.AddRange
            StatusMgr->>StatusMgr: this.Status.Clear
            Note right of StatusMgr: 把本轮所有金币/经验/道具增量<br/>合并到 statusNotify
            PostResp->>PostResp: friendManager.PostResponse
        deactivate PostResp

        NetSess->>NetSess: PackageHandler.PackMessage byte 数组
        NetSess->>Socket: socket.BeginSend
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over Player,UI: Phase 4: Client 收到响应 inferred
        Socket->>ClientProto: socket receive byte 数组
        ClientProto->>ClientProto: 反序列化为 NetMessage
        ClientProto->>CSvc: 触发 QuestService.OnQuestAccept 回调
        CSvc->>CQM: 写入新任务到本地字典 + 触发 OnQuestStatusChanged
        CQM->>CQM: allQuests[newQuestId] = quest
        CQM->>UI: OnQuestStatusChanged event
        UI->>UI: 自动刷新 新任务出现在任务列表
        Note over UI: UI 订阅了 OnQuestStatusChanged<br/>无需手动 poll
    end

    Note over QSvc: QuestService.cs:35-64 OnQuestAccept
    Note over QMgr: QuestManager.cs:56-82 AcceptQuest
    Note over QModel: Quest.cs:31-41 InitQuetsDefine<br/>Quest.cs:42-56 ToNQuestInfo
    Note over DBSvc: DBService.cs:26-32 save
